// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Collect CRM Results
// Maps created task / ticket IDs back to companies (HubSpot returns batch
// create results in input order) so the Slack alert can link to them, and
// records the company alert time in workflow memory (production executions).
